l,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-27T07:54:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-29T00:26:12Z","closed_at":"2025-04-28T23:51:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105815","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105815.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105815.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-28T23:51:20Z"},"body":"## Problem\r\n\r\nI noticed that the last two items in `anchors_preset` property's dropdown menu were not translated. Also, all the icons in this menu does not react to light/dark theme switch.\r\n\r\n![The last two presets were not translated](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40f44d92-c26d-4bb9-a801-a6c287da9142)\r\n\r\n## Cause\r\n\r\nThe preset names are actually not extracted from the `anchors_preset` property's hint string, but from texts in the control layout toolbar.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/editor/plugins/control_editor_plugin.cpp#L651-L655\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/scene/gui/control.cpp#L3990-L3993\r\n\r\nIt's `VCenter Wide` in the toolbar, while it's `V Center Wide` after prefix-trimming and calling `capitalize()` on `PresetVCenterWide`. So this entry does not have translation available.\r\n\r\nThe reason for generating names by using string magic seems to be to make it easier to concatenate the icon name (e.g. `ControlAlignVCenterWide`). I believe it's kind of over-engineering :P\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e37c6261ea48b1a339c469282df7e9b7c073a72f/editor/plugins/control_editor_plugin.cpp#L194-L199\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nThis PR updates the menu item's icon based on its enum value when editor's theme changes.\r\n\r\nOnce this is done, the string magic around hint string is no longer necessary. The preset names can be marked for translation normally.\r\n\r\np.s. Also cleaned up header includes in the files I touched.\r\n\r\n_Update:_ Marked StringNames in the static array as static so that the leak checker will be happy :P","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105815/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105815/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}